WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Alright guys, so, first of all, apologies if you hear some noises in the background, currently it's daytime, so yeah.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
So anyways, here's an example for a breaker block, so you can see we have lower low, lower high, lower low.

00:16.000 --> 00:23.000
So this is the last candle before the move to the downside, and then we have market structure shift.

00:23.000 --> 00:34.000
So now, you can see that this, so now what you can do is you can either mark out the breaker with the wick, or just mark out the body, okay, from the body.

00:34.000 --> 00:38.000
I usually mark out from the body, but you can do wick as well.

00:38.000 --> 00:48.000
So, notice that how we have fairly gap here as well, and that is overlapping with the breaker block here, right?

00:48.000 --> 00:56.000
So, price comes back, and it hits this breaker block, and then it goes up, right?

00:56.000 --> 01:05.000
So, you can see that breaker blocks are great to hold, and they are very powerful when there is fairly gap overlapping with the breaker.

01:05.000 --> 01:16.000
So you can see we had market structure shift right here, and we had our entry here, there was also a fairly gap, and also we had breaker blocks.

01:16.000 --> 01:19.000
So, that was a perfect setup.

01:19.000 --> 01:22.000
So, let me give you guys another example.

